<nav-back />
<page-overlays />
<bgm-ambience />
<view class="page page-shell paper-grain paper-real">
<scroll-view scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}" class="page-doc">
  <view class="binder"></view>
  <image class="comic-botanical" src="/plate21/module/assets/img/stickers/st-botanical-01.png" mode="aspectFit" />
  <view class="page-head">
    <view class="tag-no">No.S3</view>
  </view>

  <view class="novel">
    <view class="novel-p">沿着地图走，我来到了海晏堂遗址。眼前已经很难看出当年建筑完整的样子了，但把档案里的《海晏堂西面》铜版图和现场对照起来，还是能找到一些对应的位置。</view>
    <view class="novel-p">铜版图里，这里原本排列着十二尊人身兽首像，分别对应十二生肖，也对应一天里的十二个时辰。看到这里，我忽然想起来，调查日记中好像有一句话：</view>
  </view>
  <view class="paper-quote">“十二兽各守一时，至午而全见。”</view>
  <view class="novel"><view class="novel-p">“各守一时”应该很好理解，可“至午而全见”又是什么意思？</view></view>
  <view class="act-strip"><text class="act-strip-tag">做</text><text class="act-strip-text">根据铜版图和现场遗迹，判断正午喷泉会是什么样子</text></view>
  <audio-clip wx:if="{{narrSrc}}" src="{{narrSrc}}" label="听 · 本页讲述" dock="{{true}}" />

  <view class="comic-plate double-frame" role="img" aria-label="十二兽首按时辰喷水的四格漫画">
    <view class="tape" style="top:-20rpx; left:50%; margin-left:-90rpx;"></view>
    <image class="comic-image" src="/plate21/module/assets/img/IMG-RUNTIME-COMIC.jpg" mode="widthFix" />
  </view>
  <view class="comic-captions">
    <view class="comic-caption" wx:for="{{cells}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-index="index">
      <view class="panel-no serif">第 {{index + 1}} 格 · {{item.time}}</view>
      <view class="cell-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="q" wx:if="{{!followup}}">
    <view class="q-title serif">如果在正午来到海晏堂，当年的十二生肖喷泉会是什么样子？</view>
    <view
      wx:for="{{options}}"
      wx:key="key"
      class="hour {{selected === item.key ? 'hour-sel' : ''}}"
      data-key="{{item.key}}"
      bindtap="onSelect"
      role="button"
      aria-pressed="{{selected === item.key}}"
    >{{item.key}}　{{item.text}}</view>
    <view class="hint" wx:if="{{hint}}">{{hint}}</view>
    <button class="btn-seal" bindtap="onConfirm" disabled="{{!selected || solved}}">{{revealed ? '记 下 了' : '就 是 这 样'}}</button>
  </view>

  <view class="followup" wx:if="{{followup}}">
    <view class="novel-p">原来所谓的“水力钟”，真的就是用水来表示时间。这样一来，调查日记里的那句话也说得通了。可是这些喷泉怎么喷出的水呢？</view>
    <view class="novel-p">水力钟在眼前，水源却不在水池里。路线图在海晏堂北面另标了一处高台——蓄水楼。</view>
    <view class="novel-p">西洋楼里的喷泉不是电泵。要先弄清水是怎么被抬高的，再往东去看大水法把水做成了什么。</view>
    <button class="btn-seal" bindtap="onNext" disabled="{{advancing}}">请前往蓄水楼</button>
  </view>
</scroll-view>
</view>

<history-card
  visible="{{showHistory}}"
  title="海晏堂 · 水力钟"
  source="《西洋楼铜版图·海晏堂西面》"
  lines="{{historyLines}}"
  corner-number="{{cardNumber}}"
  show-corner="{{showHistory}}"
  btn-text="继 续"
  bind:next="onHistoryNext"
  bind:close="onCloseHistory"
/>
<stamp-toast id="stamp" />
